# Tank body, red (ticket 24.1): a squat mushroom hull of rosy red stem flesh sitting between two tread rolls, each a row of five
# umber puffball segments grown onto a core roll, like a fat caterpillar. The turret (tank-red-turret) sits on the hull's top.
# Pivot: the origin is on the ground under the middle, +z forward. The turret's pivot is at (0, 0.3, 0) in this model.
format 1
collider convex

Union
    # The treads, mirrored either side of the hull
    Material material=machine_tread
        SymmetryX
            Translate translation=(0.21, 0.1, 0)
                SmoothUnion smoothness=0.035
                    Capsule a=(0, 0, -0.25) b=(0, 0, 0.25) radius=0.07
                    LimitedRepetition spacing=0.125 limits=(0, 0, 2)
                        Sphere radius=0.088
    # The hull: a stout stem lying low, its top flattened where the turret's collar goes in, with a little gill skirt round it
    Material material=machine_red_flesh
        SmoothUnion smoothness=0.03
            Intersection
                Translate translation=(0, 0.17, 0)
                    Ellipsoid radii=(0.19, 0.15, 0.29)
                Translate translation=(0, -0.2, 0)
                    Box size=(0.4, 0.5, 0.4)
            Translate translation=(0, 0.27, 0)
                CappedCylinder radius=0.11 height=0.03
